  "prefLabel": "Opt 502.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Opt 502.01 Applicability. This part shall apply to the prescribing of opioids for the management or treatment of non-cancer and non-terminal pain and shall not apply to the supervised administration of opioids in a health care setting.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Opt 100) #5839, eff 6-17-94; ss by #6717, eff 3-24-98; ss by #7670, eff 4-4-02, EXPIRED: 4-4-10\n\nNew. #12060, eff 1-1-17; ss by #14260, eff 8-2-25, EXPIRES: 8-2-35 (formerly Opt 504) (See Chapter 500 Revision Note)",
